    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third person sci-fi shooter with 8 maps. Player mission is to kill different enemies and find hidden orange flower which is captured by enemy army. Every level has 1 hidden orange flower, finding it finish level and gives steam achievements. Player need battle against several different enemies like melee cyborg, cyborg with weapons, Shooting turrets and flying robots. So can you be the hero of the universe and find captured flowers and save world</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features::</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8 different maps<br>- Melee fight<br>- Weapons: Rifle, pistol,shotgun and throwing grenades<br>- Collect more ammos and health pick-ups<br>- Several enemies: Cyborg with melee fight and knifes, Flying enemies with weapons, Turrets with weapons. Cyborg with weapons<br>- Steam Achievements</p>",
